1
00:00:10,428 --> 00:00:15,403
I step into the heavy hall,
The shadows thick upon the wall.

2
00:00:15,658 --> 00:00:21,118
My mother whispers, cold and tight:
"You cannot see that boy tonight!"

3
00:00:21,469 --> 00:00:27,153
My Lioness is breaking free!
You cannot take his love from me!

4
00:00:27,265 --> 00:00:32,862
I am done with all of your rules!
You will not keep me in your cage!

5
00:00:37,413 --> 00:00:42,682
You talk about your lost first child,
And call my loving heart too wild!

6
00:00:42,798 --> 00:00:48,109
He broke behind the organ keys,
I will not fall upon my knees!

7
00:00:48,413 --> 00:00:53,941
My Lioness is breaking free!
You cannot take his love from me!

8
00:00:54,103 --> 00:00:59,840
I am done with all of your rules!
You will not keep me in your cage!

9
00:01:04,275 --> 00:01:09,631
I grab the heavy wooden chair,
And swing it through the heavy air.

10
00:01:09,913 --> 00:01:15,117
I smash it down against the wall,
And watch your sacred prison fall!

11
00:01:15,404 --> 00:01:20,879
My Lioness is breaking free!
You cannot take his love from me!

12
00:01:21,195 --> 00:01:26,898
I am done with all of your rules!
You will not keep me in your cage!

13
00:01:36,827 --> 00:01:41,952
The lamp is smashed, the glass goes black,
There is no way of turning back.

14
00:01:41,974 --> 00:01:46,695
My hands are bleeding on the floor,
I storm out through the heavy door!

15
00:01:47,954 --> 00:01:53,346
My Lioness is breaking free!
You cannot take his love from me!

16
00:01:53,528 --> 00:01:59,201
I am done with all of your rules!
You will not keep me in your cage!

17
00:01:59,669 --> 00:02:04,642
A roar comes tearing from my chest,
I will not be your quiet guest!

18
00:02:04,731 --> 00:02:10,415
I'm twenty-four and I am free,
I run to him, where I should be!

19
00:02:10,747 --> 00:02:16,290
I run into the darkness now,
I will not keep your holy vow.

20
00:02:16,301 --> 00:02:22,027
My bloody hands, my roaring soul,
I go to Paul, I take control!

